flow
Deploy a release

outline: the drawing needs 204 columns, and the limit is 100.

• Push a tag ✓
• Build ✓  cargo build --release
• Tests green? ◐
• Canary to 1% ○
• Error rate above 0.5%? ○
• Roll back ○
• Write the release notes ○
• Live ○
• Fix the build

Edges
  Push a tag → Build
  Build → Tests green?
  Tests green? → Canary to 1%  yes
  Tests green? → Fix the build  no
  Fix the build ⇢ Push a tag  new tag
  Canary to 1% → Error rate above 0.5%?
  Error rate above 0.5%? → Roll back  yes
  Error rate above 0.5%? → Write the release notes  no
  Write the release notes → Live

✓ done   ◐ in progress   ○ planned
